            "review_title": "Review at TacoLeo",
            "review_text": "Ditte R\n1 contribution\n0\nAbsolutely the worst restaurant\nMay 2022 • Friends\nThis is the worst experience I have ever had in a restaurant. Only two girls we working and they had no idea what they were doing. We waited 1,5 hour before we started to get our food and when it started to arrive we didn’t get what we ordered. Everything was wrong and nothing made sense. The girls were hopeless. I ordered a Mexican bowl and when I got it 6 things were missing from it. It was like the girls didn’t even know the menu and what they were supposed to make. Even the nachos which were literally chips out of the bag with nothing on them and sour crème on the side took more than 1,5 hour to make. The food was cold when we got it and not anything I would eat again. \nWhen we wanted to get our money back because we now had waisted 2 hours there and hadn’t got what we wanted at all. We got the manager on the phone but they were just as stupid and ignorant and to no use.\nThe place was also disgusting and that gave us a cup that someone else had used and it hadn’t been washed since.\n\nWORST EVER!! Don’t ever go here!! Nothing was good\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2022",
