            "review_text": "Quentin L\n4 contributions\n0\nShameful\nMay 2021 • Couples\nSimply the worst meal, let alone mexican I was unlucky to have in VN, ever. Guacamole was a shocking disgrace for 50k, a spoonful. Burrito is so dry, ill tasting and wrongly put together on a dry and brittle tortilla, I couldnt even take a third bite. Mexican Salad smelled rancid and tasted the same. Each taco was absurdly small, bland and not worth their respective price, far from it. All ingredients used were unanimously rotten, and prepared with complete ignorance, respect or care. Simply avoid this shameful scam.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2021",
