            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nNot bad~\nJul 2020 • Solo\nI ordered for home delivery, hard shell beef tacos and a quesadilla. The shells were nice and crunchy, beef etc fresh and hot and the quesadilla was quite tasty. Overall, I was pleasantly surprised. On that note, I must say the food was better than a well-known competitor and 50% less expensive.\nWritten July 19, 2020",
