            "review_text": "JunnieVN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam78 contributions\n2\nThis should be on Kitchen Nightmares of Saigon\nSep 2019 • Solo\nThe very first review that I had to write down how terrible the food was. \nNo offense, I would rate this the the worst Mexican food in town, not even real Mexican. \nMore like cold-fast-everything-cold - putting together. \nI ordered it for delivery and was in shocked open it ! \nNot mention that I ordered crispy taco, they have it delivered soft taco, but the taste of the food...I am not Mr Ramsay the Master Chief but I had exact same face expression in this case. \nAny one consider cheap cheap, can go for other locals restaurant, It is a really bad experience\n\nI would recommend anyone, be very consider before order this\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2019",
