            "review_text": "Mark G\n8 contributions\n1\nMexcellent food!\nJan 2019 • Solo\nLarge range of Mexican food all made to a very high standard and at an extremely reasonable price. Portions are generous and the quality of the meat and flavours is brilliant. \n\nThe staff are super friendly and always welcoming.\n\nI can't recommend TacoLeo enough. I went 4 nights in succession last week and was never once disappointed.\n\nIt's also just a stone's throw from Bui Vien, so there's no excuse to not go if you're in the area.\n\nMark\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 1, 2019",
