            "review_text": "Space C0y0te\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam92 contributions\n0\nGood Mexican\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI'm from Texas and tend to crave tacos and other various Mexican dishes. There are a number of Mexican options in HCMC and this is one of the better ones imo. Mexican in Vietnam is funny because no one gets it right and it's rarely authentic, but each joint tends to have their own take which is usually sufficient and different. Same here. I love it and it is affordable and fresh. Three tacos and a water run about 150k VND ($5 USD). Granted, it's near my place and they are very efficient when delivering via the Vietnammm app. Recommended. Will continue to return.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2018",
