            "review_text": "Garland B\n16 contributions\n0\nGood but not as good as all the other reviews\nJan 2018 • Couples\nI visited here tonight after walking past during the day and then doing some research on trip advisor. I got an extra large burrito with chicken. I wouldn’t say it was XL but we are in Asia. Look it wasn’t a bad burrito but all the other reviews said it was amazing and returned 6 times. I don’t think It was worth going back 6 times it was a nice break from all the other food though. Only thing I would improve on the burrito is to add the salsa in the burrito. They gave it too you on the side in a little dish for you to dip but it was not enough for the burrito making it quite dry. Price point was good at about 63k for a burrito. Overall not bad, only leaving a review because all the good reviews are what made me come and built up a high expectation.\nRead more\nWritten January 21, 2018",
